abstract: >-
  Prepared assistance-capture profile and native-export transformation tools,
  preserving stages, capture declarations, mapping provenance and unknowns.
  Optional xAPI and Caliper bindings support existing logging ecosystems.
  Candidate mappings and software checks do not establish complete capture,
  measurement superiority or learning effects.
